VALUES ('128134fd-435f-5f17-8eab-9f288bc743ef', 'bus_legal_entity', 'Legal Entity', 'A legally recognized organization or person capable of holding rights, obligations, registrations, contracts, assets, liabilities, or filings. Provide canonical governance semantics for LegalEntity. A legally recognized organization or person capable of holding rights, obligations, registrations, contracts, assets, liabilities, or filings. Used in enterprise risk, legal, compliance, audit, contract, incident, and remediation processes where applicable. Connects risks, controls, parties, legal matters, agreements, obligations, evidence and outcomes without replacing their authoritative histories. Created when identified or initiated, progressed through governed review/action, and retained after closure or supersession. Risk assessment, incident management, legal matter management, compliance, remediation, filing and audit. Enterprise risk reviews, operational incidents, legal cases, obligations and regulatory/court submissions.', 'A', FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, '8be0f28c-6162-5859-87f0-56b8d27df194', 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
